PineForge Pine v6 audit documentation
======================================

Source:  https://github.com/fullpass-4pass/pineforge-engine,
         path docs/pine_v6_audit_master.md
License: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

`pine_v6_audit_master.md` is PineForge contributors' standalone audit of
Pine v6: 38 critical + ~62 minor known divergences between TradingView's
published reference and the actual codegen/runtime behaviour.

Local modifications:
  - U+2014 EM DASH and U+2013 EN DASH characters (26 occurrences) were
    rewritten to U+002D HYPHEN-MINUS so the file passes pine-oracle's
    gremlin scan. The rewrite is punctuation-only and does not change
    rendered semantics; see commit history for the exact change.

pine-oracle indexes the audit at build time via `src/search.rs`, exposing
its sections as `kind: "audit"` results. The doc itself remains the
canonical source; consumers seeing an audit hit should expand the section
title through the section structure documented in the upstream file.

Snapshot date: see git log for vendor/pineforge-docs/pine_v6_audit_master.md.
